<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WALES TO PLAY THREE GAMES AT WEMBLEY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES TO PLAY THREE GAMES AT WEMBLEY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales will meet New Zealand, France and Scotland in three rugby union internationals at the home of English soccer next season.</p>
<p>The Welsh Rugby Union said on Thursday that Wales would play three internationals at Wembley while Cardiff Arms Park was being revamped for the 1999 World Cup.</p>
<p>The other three home internationals against Romania, Italy and Canada will be played at venues within Wales.</p>
</text>
